      },
      "description": "Coordinate greenhouse heating and ventilation using shared temperature state"
    }
  ],
  "modified_responsibilities": [],
  "dismissed_gaps": []
}
```

Every new link must include both endpoints, its shared process-model part, a
non-empty mechanism object with `cm_id`, `description`, and `payload`, and a
meaningful link description. A source ID may be repairable by the deterministic
normalizer, but omitting the mechanism or either endpoint is not a valid delta.

